{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40762","headline":"过贾浪仙旧地 · 李洞","name":"过贾浪仙旧地","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤外唐来有谪星，长江东注冷沧溟。\n境搜松雪仙人岛，吟歇林泉主簿厅。\n片月已能临榜黑，遥天何益抱坟青。\n年年谁不登高第，未胜骑驴入画屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}